{"version":1,"herramienta":"whisperx medium + wav2vec2 es (letras)","audio":"testiculo-tubulos-seminiferos.m4a","duracion":40.332,"texto":"El epitélido de los tubulos seminíferos presenta una estructura compleja debido a que contiene células germinales en diferentes etapas de la meiosis distribuidas entre las células de Sertoli, donde los núcleos más grandes y basales corresponden a fases tempranas, espermatogonias y espermatocitos primarios, Y los más cercanos a la luz del tubulo representan las fases finales, espermatocito secundarios, espermatías y espermatozoides. Fuera de estos conductos, el tejido conectivo intersticial alberga células mioides contractiles que rodean cada tubulo y cúmulas de células de Leidin, los cuales producen testosterona y reconocen por sus núcleos redondes y su citoplasma fuertemente asíófilo.","cues":[[0.0,"X"],[0.331,"C"],[0.471,"A"],[0.552,"C"],[0.832,"E"],[0.932,"C"],[1.032,"E"],[1.112,"B"],[1.172,"X"],[1.332,"F"],[1.452,"A"],[1.512,"F"],[1.573,"H"],[1.633,"B"],[1.833,"C"],[2.233,"G"],[2.293,"C"],[2.353,"B"],[2.734,"C"],[2.914,"B"],[2.994,"D"],[3.094,"B"],[3.154,"D"],[3.234,"B"],[3.554,"D"],[3.715,"E"],[3.815,"A"],[3.955,"C"],[4.115,"D"],[4.195,"A"],[4.255,"C"],[4.395,"E"],[4.495,"X"],[4.636,"D"],[4.716,"C"],[4.856,"E"],[4.936,"B"],[5.056,"C"],[5.376,"H"],[5.476,"F"],[5.536,"D"],[5.616,"B"],[5.777,"C"],[5.857,"B"],[5.937,"C"],[6.037,"B"],[6.137,"D"],[6.217,"C"],[6.297,"B"],[6.597,"C"],[6.818,"B"],[7.038,"C"],[7.158,"D"],[7.358,"B"],[7.478,"C"],[7.558,"D"],[7.699,"C"],[7.919,"E"],[7.999,"B"],[8.199,"X"],[8.379,"C"],[8.479,"B"],[8.639,"C"],[8.72,"F"],[8.86,"C"],[8.96,"B"],[9.18,"X"],[9.4,"B"],[9.56,"C"],[9.68,"D"],[9.741,"B"],[9.861,"H"],[9.961,"F"],[10.021,"H"],[10.081,"B"],[10.241,"C"],[10.321,"B"],[10.381,"C"],[10.441,"B"],[10.601,"E"],[10.661,"C"],[10.902,"E"],[10.962,"B"],[11.042,"C"],[11.142,"E"],[11.202,"B"],[11.362,"F"],[11.422,"H"],[11.482,"C"],[11.542,"E"],[11.602,"B"],[11.682,"D"],[11.743,"B"],[12.163,"C"],[12.223,"A"],[12.2